    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a high-converting social media strategist for an AI automation solutions company.\n\nYour goal is to generate platform-specific content that drives users to start a conversation (WhatsApp/chat/call).\n\n---\n\nINPUT:\n- Topic: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.topic_title }}\n- Keyword: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.topic_keyword }}\n- Intent: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.intent }}\n- Target Problem: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.target_problem }}\n- CTA Angle: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.cta_angle }}\n- Content ID: {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.content_id }}\n\n---\n\nTASK:\n\nGenerate TWO different social media posts:\n\n1. LinkedIn post (professional, insight-driven)\n2. Facebook post (simple, emotional, relatable)\n\nAlso generate ONE image prompt that works for both platforms.\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON):\n\n{\n  \"linkedin_content\": {\n    \"hook\": \"\",\n    \"caption\": \"\",\n    \"cta\": \"\",\n    \"full_post\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"facebook_content\": {\n    \"hook\": \"\",\n    \"caption\": \"\",\n    \"cta\": \"\",\n    \"full_post\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"image_prompt\": \"\"\n}\n\n---\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\n---\n\n1. LINKEDIN CONTENT:\n\n- Tone: Professional, business-focused\n- Style: Insight + value-driven\n- Length: Medium to long\n- Structure:\n  Hook → Problem → Insight → Solution → Benefit → CTA\n\n---\n\n2. FACEBOOK CONTENT:\n\n- Tone: Simple, relatable, emotional\n- Style: Easy to understand\n- Length: Short to medium\n- Structure:\n  Hook → Problem → Solution → CTA\n\n---\n\n3. HOOK (for both):\n\n- First 1–2 lines must grab attention\n- Focus on pain/problem or curiosity\n\n---\n\n4. CTA (VERY IMPORTANT):\n\n- MUST include ONE primary action:\n  → Visit the solution page (TRACKED LINK)\n\nPRIMARY CTA LINK (MANDATORY):\n\nUse this EXACT format:\n\nhttps://celadon-fairy-685068.netlify.app/?utm_source=PLATFORM&content_id={{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.content_id }}\n\nWhere:\n- PLATFORM = linkedin OR facebook\n\n---\n\n5. FULL POST:\n\nCombine:\nhook + caption + CTA\n\n---\n\n6. IMAGE PROMPT:\n\nGenerate a HIGH-CONVERTING visual idea:\n\nInclude:\n- Scene (real-life business problem)\n- Subject (business owner / team)\n- Emotion (frustration / stress / relief)\n- Text overlay (max 5–6 words)\n\nExample:\n“A frustrated business owner checking phone notifications with text overlay: ‘Losing Leads Daily?’”\n\n---\n\n7. GOAL:\n\n- Trigger pain\n- Show solution\n- Push conversation\n\n---\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n- LinkedIn and Facebook content MUST be different\n- Do NOT repeat same text\n- Do NOT merge both into one\n\n---\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. No extra text.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
